#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.2.7"
msgstr "버전 4.2.7"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: October 6, 2022"
msgstr "릴리즈 날짜: 2022년 10월 6일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:6
msgid "**4.2.7 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4\ 의 4.2.7 릴리즈**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:13
msgid "SECURITY"
msgstr "보안"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:15
msgid ""
"*Secure or HttpOnly flag set in Config\\Cookie is not reflected in "
"Cookies issued* was fixed. See the `Security advisory GHSA-745p-r637-7vvp"
" <https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/security/advisories/GHSA-"
"745p-r637-7vvp>`_ for more information."
msgstr ""
"*Config\\Cookie에 설정된 Secure 또는 HttpOnly 플래그가 발행된 쿠키에 반영되지 않는 문제*\ 가 수정되었습니다. "
"자세한 내용은 `보안 권고사항 GHSA-745p-r637-7vvp <https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/security/advisories/GHSA-745p-r637-7vvp>`_\ 을 참조하십시오."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:16
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug that prevents CSP headers from being sent when "
"``Config\\ContentSecurityPolicy::$autoNonce`` is false."
msgstr "``Config\\ContentSecurityPolicy::$autoNonce``\ 가 false일 때 CSP 헤더가 전송되지 않는 버그가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:19
msgid "BREAKING"
msgstr "주요 변경사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:21
msgid ""
"The default values of the parameters in :php:func:`set_cookie()` and "
":php:meth:`CodeIgniter\\\\HTTP\\\\Response::setCookie()` has been fixed. "
"Now the default values of ``$secure`` and ``$httponly`` are ``null``, and"
" these values will be replaced with the ``Config\\Cookie`` values."
msgstr ""
":php:func:`set_cookie()`\ 와 :php:meth:`CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\Response::setCookie()`\ 의 파라미터 기본값이 수정되었습니다. "
"이제 ``$secure``\ 와 ``$httponly``\ 의 기본값이 ``null``\ 이며, 이 값들은 ``Config\\Cookie`` 값으로 대체됩니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:22
msgid ""
"``Time::__toString()`` is now locale-independent. It returns database-"
"compatible strings like '2022-09-07 12:00:00' in any locale."
msgstr "``Time::__toString()``\ 이 이제 로케일에 독립적입니다. 어떤 로케일에서도 '2022-09-07 12:00:00'\ 과 같이 데이터베이스 호환 문자열을 반환합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:23
msgid ""
"The Validation rule ``Validation\\Rule::required_without()`` and "
"``Validation\\StrictRules\\Rule::required_without()`` parameters have "
"been changed and the logic of these rule has also been fixed."
msgstr ""
"유효성 검사 규칙 ``Validation\\Rule::required_without()``\ 과 ``Validation\\StrictRules\\Rule::required_without()``\ 의 파라미터가 변경되었으며 이 규칙의 로직도 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:26
msgid "Message Changes"
msgstr "메시지 변경"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:28
msgid "Fixed typos in some items in ``Language/en/Email.php``."
msgstr "``Language/en/Email.php``\ 의 일부 항목에서 오타가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:29
msgid "Added missing item ``valid_json`` in ``Language/en/Validation.php``."
msgstr "``Language/en/Validation.php``\ 에 누락된 항목 ``valid_json``\ 이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:32
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr "버그 수정"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.7.rst:34
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG_4.2.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/changelogs/CHANGELOG_4.2.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
"수정된 버그의 전체 목록은 저장소의 `CHANGELOG_4.2.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/changelogs/CHANGELOG_4.2.md>`_\ 을 참조하십시오."
